From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 2 Sep 2026 05:16:13 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Build real Sales dashboard: dealer/party list + rep
 assignment

Replaces the StaffHome placeholder on /staff/sales with a real
dashboard for all three Sales roles, matching the approved mockup
(gradient header, avatar, stat cards, dealer list).

What's real:
- New assigned_sales_rep field on profiles (dealers), FK'd to
  staff_profiles.email. Kept separate from the existing free-text
  staff_assigned column (used by AdminOrders' filter) to avoid
  reinterpreting whatever values already live there.
- AdminDealers: new "Assigned Sales Rep" dropdown, sourced from
  active Sales-department staff.
- get_my_dealers() RPC (SECURITY DEFINER, same pattern as
  claim_staff_profile): returns the dealers a Sales staff member can
  see, scoped by tier (own dealers / own + direct reports' dealers /
  whole Sales department). Powers the dashboard's dealer list and its
  two stat cards (count, total outstanding).

What's still "coming soon" (no data model yet, intentionally not
faked): visit logging, GPS check-in, territory map, targets,
commission, and team-performance numbers for Senior tiers.

